{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-2d2ebc", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-042ce7"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-6f3fd1"}, "note": "空の署名欄に対して、繕いの金線を出自の痕として置く。欠落ではなく別の認証の開始。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-e4b2f4", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-042ce7"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261024-96a1ec"}, "note": "重量不変でも世界の変化で老いるAIモデルと、歯車を交換しない掛け時計。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-af1860", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-042ce7"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261027-bbb4dc"}, "note": "誤りの共有で写本の家系を復元するステムマ学を、修繕跡の系譜的読みに重ねる。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-f910b7", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-042ce7"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-133ac7"}, "note": "来歴は信頼の根拠か、作られうる物語か——修繕跡にその線を引く。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-5983ee", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-6f3fd1"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-042ce7"}, "note": "落款の不在を、繕いの存在で受け止める。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-7ff605", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-0413a6"}, "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261024-6f3fd1"}, "note": "署名欄の空白を、毎回ちがう印章の連なりに転写。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261026-8f7a24", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261026-0413a6"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261027-fc7891"}, "note": "PROVの三要素による来歴と、崩れゆく宛名の個人的由来。", "created_at": "2026-10-26"}
